## SQ-GLD-02 | golden and enchanted bread, golden carrot, enchanted golden apple: edible full, effects, stack 1
@group A
@commands `/give @p goldenfood:golden_bread`, `goldenfood:enchanted_golden_bread`, `minecraft:golden_carrot`, `minecraft:enchanted_golden_apple`; at full hunger eat each; `/effect give @p minecraft:poison 30`; then `/data get entity @p ActiveEffects` after each
